{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26041","headline":"赠李黯将军 · 鲍溶","name":"赠李黯将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细柳连营石壍牢，平安狼火赤星高。\n岩云入角雕龙爽，寒日摇旗画兽豪。\n搜伏雄儿欺魍魉，射声游骑怯分毫。\n圣人唯有河[湟]恨，寰海无虞在一劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}